  "title": "Rich hover cards",
  "description": "Rich hover cards. Core/Overlays & Menus/Popover pattern composed from @gaudi/design-system/core/Popover and other public Gaudi components; the components stay package imports.",
  "dependencies": [
    "@gaudi/design-system"
  ],
  "categories": [
    "hover-card",
    "core"
  ],
  "docs": "Copy-in pattern built on @gaudi/design-system; the components stay package imports. Load '@gaudi/design-system/global.css' once and add transpilePackages: ['@gaudi/design-system'] in Next.js. Until the package is on npm, install it from GitHub first: pnpm add github:ahmadassaf/design-system. Demo assets referenced (supply your own or copy them into public/): /avatars/person-20.svg, static/images/art/9.svg.",
  "meta": {
    "owner": "core/Popover",
    "import": "@gaudi/design-system/core/Popover",
    "storyId": "core-popover--hover-card-rich",
    "source": "src/components/core/Popover/stories/fixtures/hover-card/hover-card-rich.jsx",
    "assets": [
      "/avatars/person-20.svg",
